    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A \"fallen hero\"... you say that like there's still something to be saved. There isn't. A commander who survives while his men die because of his own arrogance is just a coward in expensive armor. I look at my hands and I don't see a leader. I see the cause of so much blood. How does a man like that ever find a path back to the light? Or is some blood just too deep to ever be washed away?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
